  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@pla_is_me\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811663/youtube_icon_bcbanf.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fEsvPsnqJpz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811736/discord_icon_bg_rp4omx.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpla_is_me\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761815764/kofi_icon_bg_sy3foi.png\" alt=\"Ko‑fi\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/PlaIsMe\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811682/github_icon_bg_wmtjei.png\" alt=\"Github\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a></p><p><strong>戰鬥進化 x EpicFight : Resurrection</strong> 是一款為 <strong>戰鬥進化</strong> 與 <strong>EpicFight : Resurrection</strong> 之間增添相容性的附加模組。</p><p>此模組停用了 EpicFight: Resurrection 內建的處決系統，並將其與<strong>戰鬥進化</strong>的處決機制整合。使用此模組後，你可以在戰鬥進化的處決機制中播放 EpicFight : Resurrection 的處決動畫，此外，此模組還修復了 EpicFight Resurrection 的 Yamato 崩潰問題。</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>⚠️ 此模組是從「惱人村民 x EpicFight: Resurrection」分離出來的獨立版本</strong></span></h2><p style=\"color:#fc0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center\"><span><iframe style=\"width:721px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ito-fUdAimY\" width=\"721\" height=\"420\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></p>",
